Origin
------

MiuraStation is an independent project. It is not FlowStation, BlueStation or
Nexus-BS, and it is not endorsed by their authors. It is built on their work:

- FlowStation, by Razvan Zeces (YO6RZV) and the FlowStation contributors.
  Copyright 2026, Razvan Zeces / FlowStation.Dev. Apache License 2.0.
  https://github.com/razvanzeces/flowstation
  MiuraStation is a modified work of FlowStation: it started from the `miura`
  line of ea5gvk/flowstation, a fork of FlowStation, at commit ed2b244 (that
  branch is no longer published).
- BlueStation (tetra-bluestation), by Wouter Bokslag / Midnight Blue and the
  BlueStation contributors. Apache License 2.0.
  https://github.com/MidnightBlueLabs/tetra-bluestation
  FlowStation, and therefore MiuraStation, is a modified work of BlueStation.
- Nexus-BS, by Chris YO3TCO / Nexus-BS Project (see below).

Modification notice (Apache License 2.0, section 4(b)): the files inherited
from FlowStation and BlueStation have been modified by the MiuraStation
developers, Joaquin EA5GVK, Rafa EA7KEN and Iñaki EA8DJI: first in their fork
of FlowStation and, from MiuraStation v1.0.0 on, in the MiuraStation source
tree. `CHANGELOG.md` lists what MiuraStation adds and changes. The changes
made to the Nexus-BS files are described in their `SPDX-FileComment` lines
and in `CHANGES-NEXUS.md`.

