Parrot (private echo service):
- crates/tetra-entities/src/cmce/subentities/cc_bs/parrot.rs
- crates/tetra-entities/tests/test_parrot_bs.rs

WAP gateway codecs (IPv4/UDP helpers, WTP/WSP parsers, status pages):
- crates/tetra-entities/src/sndcp/ip.rs
- crates/tetra-entities/src/sndcp/wap_ip.rs
- crates/tetra-entities/src/sndcp/wap_status.rs

SNDCP packet-data bearer (SN-SAP primitives, SN-UNITDATA / SN-DATA and transfer
control PDU codecs, tests adapted from Nexus-BS):
- crates/tetra-saps/src/sn.rs
- crates/tetra-entities/src/sndcp/transfer.rs
- crates/tetra-entities/src/sndcp/unitdata.rs
- crates/tetra-entities/tests/test_packet_data_nexus_bs.rs

LLC advanced link (AL-SETUP, AL-DATA / AL-FINAL and AL-ACK / AL-RNR PDU codecs; the
advanced link engine, with parts adapted from the Nexus-BS LLC):
- crates/tetra-pdus/src/llc/pdus/al_setup.rs
- crates/tetra-pdus/src/llc/pdus/al_data.rs
- crates/tetra-pdus/src/llc/pdus/al_ack.rs
- crates/tetra-entities/src/llc/advanced_link.rs

Packet-data channels of several slots (the half-duplex guard, and the uplink
grant counted over the slots of the channel when the slot carrying it is
built, following the Nexus-BS scheduler):
- crates/tetra-entities/src/umac/subcomp/bs_sched/multislot.rs

